            <div xml:id="d958">

                <pb facs="0972" n="960" xml:id="pg960"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">561.35E1A/113: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Johnson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-10-05T19:00:00-05:00">October 5, 1937—7
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>412. Your 631, October 5, 6 p.m. For your information and possible use, the
                    Department is to discuss this matter with Mr. Davis but can not do so before the
                    end of the week.</p>
                <p>Report amply Council discussions on this point. What have Dominican and Peruvian
                    delegates had to say on this matter and as to their expectations or plans for
                    production for this quota year?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
